/ Writes run.snapshot beside this goal: a run stopped at its save inside Sub, for FreshAppGoesOn.test.goal to resume
/ in an app of its own. Not a test. Run it again when this goal or Sub changes (the resume then answers 409, the goal's
/ hash changed), from test/: plang plan/snapshot/module/snapshot/resume/FreshAppGoesOn/Record.goal
Record
- set %where% = 'run.snapshot'
- set %name% = "Alice"
- set %count% = 0
- call Sub city="Reykjavik"
- set %unwound% = "yes"
- save %snapshot% to %where%
